Here is the generated code to evaluate:

<!-- @FIGURE_UI_BEGIN -->
<span style="display:block;font-weight:700;font-size:12px;">Diffusion between two bulbs</span>
<span id="stepTitle" style="display:block;font-weight:600;color:#12626f;"></span>
